#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/gst10-plugins-bad.xml:183
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of GStreamer Bad Plug-ins"
msgstr "Instalação do GStreamer Bad Plug-ins"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/gst10-plugins-bad.xml:192
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>GStreamer Bad Plug-ins</application> by running the "
"following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>GStreamer Bad Plug-ins</application> executando os "
"seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/gst10-plugins-bad.xml:196
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson  setup ..            \\\n"
"       --prefix=/usr       \\\n"
"       --buildtype=release \\\n"
"       -Dgpl=enabled       \\\n"
"       -Dpackage-origin=https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/view/&blfs-version;/ \\\n"
"       -Dpackage-name=\"GStreamer &gst10-plugins-bad-version; BLFS\" &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson  setup ..            \\\n"
"       --prefix=/usr       \\\n"
"       --buildtype=release \\\n"
"       -Dgpl=enabled       \\\n"
"       -Dpackage-origin=https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/view/&blfs-version;/ \\\n"
"       -Dpackage-name=\"GStreamer &gst10-plugins-bad-version; BLFS\" &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#.  Upstream issue is
#. https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/gstreamer/gstreamer/-/issues/3124
#.  Upstream issue gst-plugins-bad/#1426
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/gst10-plugins-bad.xml:208
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To test the results, issue: <command>ninja test</command>. Several tests "
"need a terminal emulator in a graphical session. Three tests, "
"<emphasis>elements_vacompositor</emphasis>, "
"<emphasis>elements_netsim</emphasis>, and "
"<emphasis>elements_dash_mpd</emphasis>, are known to fail.  If <xref "
"linkend='gst10-plugins-good'/> is not installed, two tests "
"<emphasis>elements_rtpsrc</emphasis> and "
"<emphasis>elements_rtpsink</emphasis> will fail."
msgstr ""
"Para testar os resultados, emita: <command>ninja test</command>. Vários "
"testes necessitam de um emulador de terminal em uma sessão gráfica. Três "
"testes, <emphasis>elements_vacompositor</emphasis>, "
"<emphasis>elements_netsim</emphasis> e <emphasis>elements_dash_mpd</"
"emphasis>, são conhecidos por falharem. Se <xref linkend='gst10-plugins-"
"good'/> não estiver instalado, dois testes <emphasis>elements_rtpsrc</"
"emphasis> e <emphasis>elements_rtpsink</emphasis> falharão."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/gst10-plugins-bad.xml:222
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/gst10-plugins-bad.xml:225
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/gst10-plugins-bad.xml:229
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/gst10-plugins-bad.xml:235
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-Dgpl=enabled</parameter>: Without this switch, plugins with "
"dependencies on (A)GPL licensed libraries are not built."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-Dgpl=enabled</parameter>: Sem essa chave, plugins com "
"dependências de bibliotecas licenciadas (A)GPL não são construídos."

